2. The conversion engine — proprietary, redistributable with this tool
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Applies to `src/engine/` (`converter.js`, `elementor-components.js`).

Copyright (c) 2026 Leo (htmltoelementor.com). All rights reserved.

You may use, run and redistribute these files **as part of this package**,
including inside your own build pipelines and commercial client work, at no
